/121815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121815.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-28T20:05:18Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nI improperly introduced a NULL define (`XR_NULL_ENTITY`), probably because the official one wasn't yet known at the time.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes its usage to the official `XR_NULL_SPATIAL_ENTITY_ID_EXT`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis was discovered when implementing the first piece of logic that makes  use of this in GDExtensions. As we never exposed the constant, using the correct OpenXR constant failed.\r\nTechnically this is a minor breaking change but seeing the circumstances we can likely do this with no real impact.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com